("L5","First, the rules of the game. The CRA certifies tax software every single year. For the twenty twenty-five tax year, the one Canadians filed this spring, seventeen products made the list."),
("L6","You have to use software certified for the year you're filing. And the CRA loads that list in random order, on purpose. It doesn't rank them, and neither should a sales page."),
("L7","Here's the part most reviews skip. The tax law inside every certified program is the same law. Enter the same slips correctly, and the tax owed doesn't change because you paid more for the app."),
("L8","So what are you actually paying for? Three things. Which forms you can use. How much help you get. And what happens if the CRA comes back with questions."),
("L9","Two more facts that matter for everyone. Auto-fill My Return pulls your slips straight from the CRA into the software. But it only works through a CRA account. If you sign in with an Alberta dot ca account or a B C Services Card, it won't connect."),
("L10","And the slips usually aren't all there until mid-March. The CRA says most third-party information arrives by the end of February, and is processed by mid-March. File in the first week, and you may be missing a slip."),
# ACT 3 CONTENDERS
("L11","Now, the contenders. Seven well-known programs, and every one of them is on the CRA's certified list."),
("L12","Wealthsimple Tax. The Basic plan is pay what you want, and that includes zero. Plus is forty dollars, with audit protection. Pro is eighty, with access to tax experts."),
("L13","TurboTax. Free for simple returns only. Then thirty, fifty and seventy dollars per return, depending on what's in your tax year."),
("L14","H and R Block. Almost the same ladder. Free for simple returns, then twenty-nine ninety-nine, forty-nine ninety-nine and sixty-nine ninety-nine."),
("L15","UFile. Online starts at twenty dollars and ninety-five cents. You can prepare everything for free, and you pay only when you're ready to file."),
("L16","StudioTax. An app you install on a computer or a phone, not a website. On a computer, it's seventeen dollars and fifty cents for a licence that covers ten returns."),
