("L44","Let's put the scoreboard together. Four people. Seven programs. What each one would actually pay, based on the published prices."),
("L45","Two programs come out at zero in every round. Wealthsimple Basic, and GenuTax. The big brands climb from zero to seventy, as the return gets more complex."),
