("L46","And now the surprise. If the cheapest option works for everyone, why do the paid tiers exist at all?"),
("L47","Because price isn't the only score. Look at what the money buys."),
("L48","Wealthsimple Plus at forty dollars adds audit protection and priority support. CloudTax Plus at thirty-nine adds audit protection for the main account holder. H and R Block sells expert help on top of its software."),
("L49","GenuTax gives you no expert at all. It's a free Windows program, and you're on your own. StudioTax keeps your files on your own device, not in the cloud, which some people want, and some people don't."),
